ioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/activities/ActivitiesScreen.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check the AddActivityScreen to see what might be causing the loading issue:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_011pwPSAPY4uQobdaejcfsGM","statusText":"Viewed file (lines 1:284)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/activities/AddActivityScreen.kt","fsPath":"C:/Users/jeepi/AndroidStudioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/activities/AddActivityScreen.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check the AddActivityViewModel to see what might be causing the loading state to persist:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_014FiRbV2DKEUvo3WGtQUeWy","statusText":"Viewed file (lines 1:158)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/viewmodel/AddActivityViewModel.kt","fsPath":"C:/Users/jeepi/AndroidStudioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/viewmodel/AddActivityViewModel.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"I found the issue! The problem is in the `loadData()` function in the `AddActivityViewModel`. The code is using `collect` on the flows from the repository, but it's not handling them correctly. The `collect` function is a suspending function that never completes - it keeps collecting values from the flow indefinitely. This means the loading state never gets set to false because the coroutine never reaches the line that updates the UI state.

Let me check the repository to see what methods are available:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01JszXu32rxDWKtfUZNuqyri","title":"File search","statusText":"Done","status":"SUCCESS","isHidden":false},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01QwthcyDWQWGo4NiPG5vpHc","statusText":"Viewed file (lines 1:258)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/data/repository/CattleRepository.kt","fsPath":"C:/Users/jeepi/AndroidStudioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/data/repository/CattleRepository.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I can see the issue clearly. The problem is in the `loadData()` function in the `AddActivityViewModel`. The code is trying to collect from flows, but it's doing it incorrectly. When you call `collect` on a Flow, it's a suspending function that continues to collect values indefinitely. The code after the `collect` calls never gets executed, so `isLoading` never gets set to false.

The solution is to use `first()` instead of `collect` to get the first (current) value from the flows, or to restructure the code to handle the flows properly.

