## Summary
A comprehensive Android application for managing cattle records, built with Jetpack Compose and Room database. The app allows tracking of cattle, pastures, and activities with a modern Material 3 UI.

## Structure
- **app/**: Main application module
 - **src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/**: Source code
 - **data/**: Data layer (models, DAOs, database)
 - **ui/**: UI components and screens
 - **navigation/**: Navigation configuration
 - **src/androidTest/**: Instrumentation tests
 - **src/test/**: Unit tests

## Language & Runtime
**Language**: Kotlin
**Version**: 2.0.21
**Build System**: Gradle (Kotlin DSL)
**Package Manager**: Gradle
**JVM Target**: Java 11
**Android SDK**: 
- **Compile SDK**: 36
- **Target SDK**: 36
- **Min SDK**: 30

## Dependencies
**Main Dependencies**:
- Jetpack Compose (2024.09.00)
- Room Database (2.6.1)
- Navigation Compose (2.8.5)
- Lifecycle ViewModel (2.9.2)
- Material 3
- Kotlin Coroutines

**Development Dependencies**:
- JUnit (4.13.2)
- Espresso (3.7.0)
- Compose UI Testing

## Build & Installation
```bash
./gradlew assembleDebug
```
Installation:
```bash
./gradlew installDebug
```

## Testing
**Frameworks**: 
- JUnit for unit tests
- AndroidX Test for instrumentation tests
- Espresso for UI testing

**Test Location**: 
- Unit tests: `app/src/test/`
- Instrumentation tests: `app/src/androidTest/`

**Run Command**:
```bash
./gradlew test # Unit tests
./gradlew connectedCheck # Instrumentation tests
```

## Database Schema
**Database Engine**: Room (SQLite)
**Version**: 2
**Entities**:
- Cows: Animal records with tag numbers, birth dates, gender, etc.
- Pastures: Land management with acreage and assigned animals
- Activities: Events like moves, births, sales with dates and notes
- Settings: Application configuration storage

**Features**:
- Type converters for complex data types
- Migration support
- Foreign key relationships
- DAO pattern for data access","alwaysApply":true}]},{"id":"d6d543ac-2be8-4dbd-a298-c4fcd1e71ab0","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can see you're experiencing several issues with the sign-in and account management functionality. Let me investigate the current implementation to understand what's happening."},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01QxfW7ZtL1SoMdi5onVbc7T","title":"File search","statusText":"Done","status":"SUCCESS","isHidden":false},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01BHbdpj1eigesMMo2Rkugyq","title":"File search","statusText":"Done","status":"SUCCESS","isHidden":false},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01PbYu3cXCCYzNLkkxEra2Md","title":"File search","statusText":"Done","status":"SUCCESS","isHidden":false},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01GbQk3v7rtpP1B7DFv769Tq","title":"File search","statusText":"Done","status":"SUCCESS","isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Let me examine the settings screen first to understand the current implementation:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01VsnCMNDW7Cx4MbkF6DKSWk","statusText":"Viewed file (from the beginning up to line 400)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/settings/SettingsScreen.kt","fsPath":"C:/Users/jeepi/AndroidStudioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/settings/SettingsScreen.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check the sign-in screen to understand the authentication flow:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01UbHUBtdSGZa9AQqW5EyDkh","statusText":"Viewed file (from the beginning up to line 400)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/auth/SignInScreen.kt","fsPath":"C:/Users/jeepi/AndroidStudioProjects/cows/app/src/main/java/com/jumblemint/cows/ui/screens/auth/SignInScreen.kt"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"text","text":"Let me check the herd selection screen to understand the herd manage